		{"id":"6d3df7bdb6ea845f","type":"text","text":"## Legend\n- Cyan = CRM (our team)\n- Purple = Workflow team\n- Green = Stock team\n- Orange = Production team\n- Red = open question\n- Yellow = manual path\n\nEvery arrow that ends in the CRM lane is a status webhook. The thread that ties all steps together is the **sales order ID** plus the **Stock invoice ID**.","x":10400,"y":-1340,"width":520,"height":360},
		{"id":"59a042b5070cdb9f","type":"text","text":"## Rules for every message\n- Carries sales order ID, run ID, its own message ID, time, sender (system or named person)\n- Same message twice = applied once\n- Out of order = keep the latest by time\n- Receiver answers \"received\"; sender retries if not\n- Version number on every message shape","x":10980,"y":-1340,"width":520,"height":360},
		{"id":"af8d0fc85eaaac96","type":"text","text":"## Problems from the whiteboard\n1. Stock never receives the invoice number → fix: invoice is sent to Stock, Stock returns its invoice ID\n2. Pick agent never finds anything → likely caused by 1 and 4; retest after fixing them\n3. Stock count not reduced → Stock team reduces it in its own logic at stock update\n4. Products don't match → every order line carries the master data product ID","x":11560,"y":-1340,"width":620,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0136451515849185","type":"text","text":"**6. Verify and pick**\nPicker picks, counts, scans QR per pallet","x":12490,"y":180,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"9a5075085fd68974","type":"text","text":"**Wait for production ends**\nRun resumes (same run)","x":12540,"y":1210,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"2fef61c2b08facd8","type":"text","text":"**Pick agent**\nPallet, rack, gate","x":12840,"y":1210,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"97c1da5f5e5f4ff3","type":"text","text":"**7. Dispatch details**\nDestination, loading time, e-way bill, truck, driver","x":12820,"y":180,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"24d5d275e281ae2b","type":"text","text":"**Same as happy path 5–8**\nCheck plan → pick → dispatch → stock update","x":13140,"y":1460,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ea734237ce16ac7f","type":"text","text":"**Order completed**\nFulfilled, invoice + e-way bill shown","x":13440,"y":960,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3dc846fb6c5e9a42","type":"text","text":"**8. Stock update**\nCount reduced, who, when\nNext order sees new count","x":13140,"y":180,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0e66a3159f85fff9","type":"text","text":"Status from Stock only, or from the workflow too? Two senders = duplicates.","x":13840,"y":-40,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cb980592eda4e0b9","type":"text","text":"Finance: final tax invoice at order time means tax is due from that date.","x":13840,"y":130,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7da8142f14fa0a42","type":"text","text":"Who sets production priority? (probably salesperson)","x":13840,"y":900,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"683ab7167d40924e","type":"text","text":"Workflow times out at 72h — wait-for-production needs a longer limit. How long does production take?","x":13840,"y":1070,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"97c5a6d1b3a8dd45","type":"text","text":"Production can't deliver → see Cancellation flow below.","x":13840,"y":1240,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"364b9a04e8014363","type":"text","text":"What if goods are already made or loaded when a cancel arrives?","x":13840,"y":2350,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3080926531dc8fe9","type":"text","text":"**9. Order completed**\nMark fulfilled, show invoice and e-way bill","x":13440,"y":-350,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"5733e5c9dda02f46","type":"text","text":"Who sends the invoice to Stock: CRM directly or the workflow? Proposal: workflow.","x":13840,"y":-380,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c4819d8fad517646","type":"text","text":"Does the Stock app complete the workflow's steps 5–8, or run them itself while the workflow waits?","x":13840,"y":-210,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ca18930dfab0f49d","type":"text","text":"If the order is cancelled, the held 3 must be released — see Cancellation flow.","x":13840,"y":2180,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"1"},
