			"id":"e3ea062567cf5fb3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Let us start enhancing UI page for accounts.\n* Remove micropage\nI will share the changes here we will enhance the design\n1. In overview section remove description (micropage) for recent activity and contacts\n2. remove complete prospecting tab and its related stale code. \n3. remove filters in sidebar of the accounts page \n\t1. All\n\t2. customer\n\t3. prospects\n\t4. partners\n\t5. remove ALL SYSTEMS ACTIVE and 20 orgs\n\t6. remove refresh button \n\t7. remove company website from the list (micropage)\n4. remove email button from top right corner\n5. Remove the micropage i mean description where ever it is present in the accounts page. \n\nDo you understand?",
