			"id":"4ad2907892c94ef6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Oct 10 tasks\n\n1. Need to create new page where we show all the contacts progress so that we can see it in one single page\n\t1. that must have feature of exporting to different formats. \n\t2. also must be included values, current status, timelines, deadlines etc., \n2. Need to define the owners of the contacts\n\t1. currently we have one level owner assign need to define two level of owner\n\t\t1. owner of the application and L1 manager\n3. Need to add the value of the product\n\t1. it is like i am saying this product or this sale has this much of value. ",
