			"text":"1. Create quotation\n2. Save as draft\n3. Send quotation\n4. Record customer answer\n\t1. Yes\n\t\t1. Accept and mark it as **deal won** and create sales order\n\t2. Negotiation\n\t\t1. Communication\n\t\t\t1. Accept \n\t\t\t\t1. **deal won**\n\t\t\t\t2. create sales order\n\t\t\t2. Reject\n\t\t\t\t1. **deal lost**\n\t3. No\n\t\t1. Reject and mark it as **deal lost** and closed",
