		{
			"id":"db8bb05c20e0ceac",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Sales stock-out flow\n\nBase: `http://localhost:3003/api/stock`\ndev: `https://erpstockdev.keehoo.ai/api/stock`\n\nThe backend starts and advances the workflow. Call only the APIs below.\n\n```bash\nBASE=\"http://localhost:3003/api/stock\"\nORG=\"<organization-id>\"\nTOKEN=\"<bearer-token>\"\n```\n\nServer env used by the start call: `WORKFLOW_BASE_URL`, `WORKFLOW_SESSION_TOKEN`, `WORKFLOW_STOCK_OUT_ID` (default `fccea020-3f4f-4790-814e-e90d882f5ee3`). An active `stock_out` workflow binding overrides the id.\n\nWORKFLOW_BASE_URL=https://devworkflow.bkruise.ai/api/kruise\n\nWORKFLOW_SESSION_TOKEN=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..mRFJaWLshZhKOoyiU4wAJ8DT49evl9h8YBjJi9U_uSY\n\nWORKFLOW_STOCK_OUT_ID=fccea020-3f4f-4790-814e-e90d882f5ee3\n\n\n\n\nBefore every task complete, call pending tasks and use `items[].task_id` from that response.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n`GET /{orgId}/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending`\n\n## 1. Start the stock-out\n\n`POST /{orgId}/sales/stock-out`\n\nCreates the stock-out and starts the flow. Save `stockOutId` and `workflow.instanceId`.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/sales/stock-out\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"so_number\": \"SO-2026-00421\",\n    \"so_date\": \"2026-08-20\",\n    \"customer_distributor\": \"Acme Distributors\",\n    \"material_code\": \"Broom\",\n    \"quantity\": 120,\n    \"uom\": \"PCS\",\n    \"delivery_location\": \"Pune DC\",\n    \"required_delivery_date\": \"2026-08-22\"\n  }'\n```\n\n## 2. OCR\n\n`POST /{orgId}/purchase/finance/invoices/ocr`\n\nMultipart. `stockOutId` makes this extract-only: the bill is not saved yet. Response field `form` is the invoice body for the invoice task.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/finance/invoices/ocr\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/path/to/invoice.pdf\" \\\n  -F \"stockOutId=<stock-out-id>\"\n```\n\nPending task, then complete the invoice task with that form.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"invoiceNumber\": \"SI-2026-00421\",\n      \"invoiceDate\": \"2026-08-20\",\n      \"buyerName\": \"Acme Distributors\",\n      \"totalAmount\": 236,\n      \"lineItems\": [\n        { \"name\": \"Broom\", \"quantity\": 2, \"rate\": 100 }\n      ]\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n## 3. Stock availability\n\nThis is an API. The stock-out step does not calculate it.\n\n`POST /{orgId}/inventory/items/quantities`\n\nSend `itemIds`, `itemNames`, or both. Optional `warehouseId`. Open reservations are excluded. Items with no free stock are omitted.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/inventory/items/quantities\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"itemNames\": [\"Broom\", \"Floor Cleaner 5L\"]\n  }'\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"itemId\": \"<uuid>\", \"name\": \"Broom\", \"unit\": \"pcs\", \"onHandQty\": 48 }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nPallet labels for the reserve step come from:\n\n`GET /{orgId}/inventory/items?itemName=Broom`\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/inventory/items\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"itemName=Broom\"\n```\n\nUse `placements[].label` as `pallet` in the next step.\n\n## 4. Stock recommendation (reserve)\n\nThere is no separate reserve URL. Completing the recommendation task reserves the pallets against this `stockOutId`.\n\n`GET /{orgId}/sales/stock-out/{stockOutId}/fifo-pick` only suggests the oldest bin. It does not reserve.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/sales/stock-out/<stock-out-id>/fifo-pick\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"material_code=Broom\"\n```\n\nPending task, then complete it.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"pick_allocations\": [\n        {\n          \"pallet\": \"A1-B2-L1-P1\",\n          \"item\": \"Broom\",\n          \"pick_quantity\": 6,\n          \"warehouse\": \"WH1\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n`pallet` is the bin label. `pick_quantity` must be greater than 0. That call holds the pallet until a later step issues the stock or the stock-out is cancelled.\n\n## Later steps\n\nCall pending, then complete, for each task. `decision` is `approved`. Put the step fields in `data`.\n\n### Vehicle plan\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"vehicle_no\": \"MH12AB1234\",\n      \"driver_name\": \"Sunil\",\n      \"transporter\": \"Swift Logistics\"\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n### Loading\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"loading_sheet_no\": \"LS-00421\",\n      \"picked_quantity\": 120,\n      \"loaded_quantity\": 120,\n      \"fifo_check\": \"Yes\"\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n### Loading completion\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"seal_no\": \"SEAL-00421\",\n      \"total_packages\": 12\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n### Dispatch\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"dispatch_no\": \"DSP-00421\",\n      \"vehicle_no\": \"MH12AB1234\",\n      \"gate_out_datetime\": \"2026-08-21T12:00:00+05:30\"\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n### Transit\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"transit_status\": \"In transit\",\n      \"current_location\": \"Satara\"\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n### Proof of delivery\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"pod_no\": \"POD-00421\"\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n### Stock update\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -G \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/pending\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"instance_id=<workflow.instanceId>\"\n```\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$BASE/$ORG/purchase/workflow/tasks/<task-id>/complete\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"decision\": \"approved\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"stock_updated\": true\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\nLoading completion, dispatch, and stock update issue the reserved quantity. Proof of delivery or stock update marks the stock-out `completed`.\n\nRead the document:\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS \"$BASE/$ORG/sales/stock-out/<stock-out-id>\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"\n```",
