			"id":"3ff8251ee2ea3158",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## API 5 - production post api call\n\n**Request:** POST API\n```json\n# independent item call(bottle api call)\n{\n\t  \"item_id\":\"\",\n\t  \"sales_id\": \"\",\n\t  \"quantity\": \"\",\n\t  \"UOM\": \"\",\n\t  \"priority\": \"\",\n\t  \"order_date\": \"\",\n\t  \"delivery_date\": \"\",\n\t  \"note\": \"\" \n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n\t\"sales_id\": \"\",\n\t\"item_id\": \"\",\n\t\"status\": \"completed/pending/failed\",\n\t\"completed_date\": \"\"\n}\n```",
